window.UNIDADES_I18N_RESOURCES = {"es":{"translation":{"meta":{"title_passenger":"P2L Usuario — Descubre lo que necesitas cerca de ti","title_driver":"P2L Operativo — Opera donde está la demanda","title_fleet":"P2L Empresa — Convierte tu ubicación en un canal de ventas","description":"P2L es una plataforma geográfica que conecta oferta y demanda de movilidad, bienes, servicios y domicilios mediante canales geográficos, geovallas y broadcast."},"nav":{"benefits":"Beneficios","services":"Servicios","how":"Cómo funciona","drivers":"Operativo","fleet":"Empresa","plans":"Planes","payments":"Tarifas y pagos","use_tuki":"Ir a la plataforma","menu_open":"Abrir menú","menu_close":"Cerrar menú","main":"Principal","home":"P2L inicio","profile_tabs":"Elige tu perfil","language":"Idioma","whatsapp":"Contactar por WhatsApp al 318 781 3116"},"modes":{"passenger":"Usuario","driver":"Operativo","fleet":"Empresa"},"hero":{"passenger":{"eyebrow":"👤 Usuario · Oferta y demanda cerca de ti","title":"Descubre lo que necesitas <em>cerca de ti</em>","lead":"Muévete, descubre negocios, encuentra servicios y solicita productos según tu ubicación. P2L conecta tu demanda con la oferta que está cerca.","badges":[{"icon":"🚗","strong":"Movilidad","rest":"viajes cerca"},{"icon":"🛍️","strong":"Descubre","rest":"oferta local"},{"icon":"🛵","strong":"Domicilios","rest":"en tu zona"}],"pill":"Cerca de ti","phone_title":"Oferta a 120 m","phone_sub":"Canal geo · Chat activo"},"driver":{"eyebrow":"⚙️ Operativo · Conductor, repartidor u operador","title":"Opera donde está la <em>demanda</em>","lead":"Recibe solicitudes, ejecuta servicios y descubre oportunidades mientras te mueves por tu zona. El operativo también participa de la red de oferta y demanda de P2L.","badges":[{"icon":"📍","strong":"Solicitudes","rest":"cerca de ti"},{"icon":"⚡","strong":"Tiempo real","rest":"estados y recorridos"},{"icon":"🛍️","strong":"Descubre","rest":"oferta en tu ruta"}],"pill":"En línea","phone_title":"Nueva solicitud a 350 m","phone_sub":"Acepta · Opera · Completa"},"fleet":{"eyebrow":"🏢 Empresa · Broadcast de canal geográfico","title":"Convierte tu ubicación en un <em>canal de ventas</em>","lead":"Activa el broadcast de tu canal geográfico (geovalla) y permite que personas y operadores descubran tu negocio, productos y servicios cuando estén cerca. Tu empresa. Tu zona. Tu canal.","badges":[{"icon":"📡","strong":"Broadcast","rest":"geovalla y suscripción"},{"icon":"💬","strong":"Chat","rest":"con quien se suscribe"},{"icon":"🛍️","strong":"Oferta","rest":"bienes, servicios, domicilios"}],"pill":"Broadcast activo","phone_title":"Tu negocio en el mapa","phone_sub":"Broadcast · Oferta · Chat"}},"passenger":{"benefits_title":"P2L conecta tu demanda con la oferta que está cerca","benefits_lead":"Oferta y demanda conectadas por ubicación: movilidad, bienes y servicios, y domicilios en una sola plataforma geográfica.","b1_title":"Movilidad","b1_text":"Solicita un viaje y encuentra operadores disponibles cerca de ti. Mapa, chat y seguimiento en tiempo real.","b2_title":"Descubre","b2_text":"Encuentra restaurantes, tiendas, propiedades y servicios alrededor de tu ubicación, sin haber pedido un viaje.","b3_title":"Domicilios","b3_text":"Solicita productos y servicios de negocios que operan en tu zona, a través del broadcast del canal geográfico de la empresa.","services_title":"Elige cómo quieres participar en P2L","services_lead":"Una plataforma. Tres formas de entrar: usuario, operativo o empresa. Todo conectado por ubicación.","s1_tag":"Usuario","s1_title":"Descubre, solicita y muévete","s1_text":"Pide un viaje, encuentra negocios cercanos, solicita domicilios y suscríbete al broadcast de canales geográficos.","s2_tag":"Operativo","s2_title":"Recibe solicitudes y opera servicios","s2_text":"Conductor, repartidor u operador de campo: ejecuta servicios cerca de ti y también descubres oferta local.","s3_tag":"Empresa","s3_title":"Publica tu oferta y activa tu canal","s3_text":"Restaurante, tienda, inmobiliaria, hotel, flota o comercio: tu negocio tiene un canal dentro del mapa.","s4_tag":"Movilidad","s4_title":"Uber-like, a tu manera","s4_text":"Solicita un viaje, indica origen y destino, y conecta con operadores disponibles cerca de ti.","s5_tag":"Marketplace","s5_title":"Airbnb-like local","s5_text":"Descubre propiedades, restaurantes, tiendas y servicios profesionales alrededor de tu ubicación.","s6_tag":"Domicilios","s6_title":"Rappi-like en tu zona","s6_text":"Entra al broadcast (geovalla), descubre una empresa, suscríbete a su canal y recibe avisos cuando regreses.","how_title":"Utiliza P2L en 3 pasos","how_lead":"Entra con tu cuenta Google y empieza a descubrir oferta cerca de ti.","step1_title":"Inicia sesión","step1_text":"Accede con Google desde la web o tu dispositivo. Sin formularios largos.","step2_title":"Descubre según tu ubicación","step2_text":"Muévete, encuentra negocios cercanos o solicita un viaje o un domicilio en tu zona.","step3_title":"Conecta con la oferta","step3_text":"Suscríbete al broadcast del canal geográfico, chatea con la empresa y recibe avisos cuando vuelvas a la zona.","start_free":"Empezar ahora — es gratis","highlight_title":"Tu ubicación conecta la oferta con la demanda","highlight_text":"El broadcast es la geovalla de negocio: Airbnb con punto fijo, domicilio en un radio de acción, o el local al que acabas de entrar. Te suscribes una vez al canal; cuando vuelves, la app te notifica y abre el chat con la empresa. Una experiencia Uber-like para moverte, Airbnb-like para descubrir oferta local y Rappi-like para solicitar domicilios.","explore":"Explorar la app","lost_title":"¿Olvidaste algo en el vehículo?","lost_text":"Si usaste movilidad, desde la app puedes contactar al operativo o reportar un inconveniente para recibir ayuda.","go_app":"Ir a la app","cta_title":"¿Quieres operar con P2L?","cta_text":"Recibe solicitudes, ejecuta servicios y descubre oportunidades en tu zona. También puedes registrar tu negocio y activar el broadcast de tu canal geográfico.","register_driver":"Entrar como operativo","fleet_panel":"Empresa"},"driver":{"benefits_title":"Conecta tu operación con la demanda de tu zona","benefits_lead":"El operativo no solo recibe servicios. También participa de la red de oferta y demanda de P2L mientras se mueve.","b1_title":"Solicitudes cercanas","b1_text":"Recibe servicios y solicitudes de usuarios que están cerca: viajes, domicilios u operación de campo.","b2_title":"Operación en tiempo real","b2_text":"Gestiona estados, recorridos, solicitudes y servicios desde tu dispositivo, cuando tú decidas estar en línea.","b3_title":"Chat","b3_text":"Coordina directamente con usuarios y empresas. Misma conversación en la app y en el dashboard.","services_title":"Capacidades del operativo","services_lead":"Conductor, repartidor, operador o personal de servicio: todo lo que necesitas para operar en la plataforma geográfica.","s1_tag":"Disponibilidad","s1_title":"Modo en línea","s1_text":"Actívate para recibir solicitudes cercanas y pausa cuando no estés disponible.","s2_tag":"Matching","s2_title":"Aceptar o rechazar","s2_text":"Revisa origen, destino y valor estimado antes de aceptar un servicio.","s3_tag":"Operación","s3_title":"Servicio en curso","s3_text":"Gestiona el estado: en camino, en el punto de encuentro y finalizado.","s4_tag":"Mapa","s4_title":"Recorrido en vivo","s4_text":"Visualiza la ruta y la ubicación del usuario durante todo el servicio.","s5_tag":"Actividad","s5_title":"Historial de servicios","s5_text":"Consulta servicios completados y la actividad reciente del día.","s6_tag":"Red P2L","s6_title":"Descubre mientras operas","s6_text":"Al circular por una zona también puedes descubrir negocios, servicios, propiedades y ofertas cercanas, suscribirte al broadcast del canal y chatear.","how_title":"Empieza a operar en 3 pasos","how_lead":"Regístrate en el panel, únete a una empresa o crea la tuya, y abre la app.","step1_title":"Regístrate","step1_text":"Entra al panel empresa y crea o únete a una organización.","step2_title":"Activa tu rol","step2_text":"El administrador te agrega como operativo. Tú abres la app e inicias sesión.","step3_title":"Recibe solicitudes","step3_text":"Ponte en línea, acepta servicios cercanos y descubre oferta en tu zona.","open_app":"Abrir app operativo","highlight_title":"El operativo también participa de la red","highlight_text":"No solo recibes servicios. Entras al radio de un comercio, una propiedad o un domicilio, te suscribes al broadcast del canal y la empresa puede volver a conectarse cuando regresas a la zona.","go_panel":"Ir al panel","cta_title":"Opera con P2L","cta_text":"Conecta tu operación con la demanda de tu zona y descubre negocios cercanos mientras te mueves. También puedes registrar tu propia empresa.","register_driver":"Entrar como operativo","fleet_panel":"Empresa"},"fleet":{"benefits_title":"Tu empresa. Tu zona. Tu canal.","benefits_lead":"P2L permite a cualquier negocio activar una presencia comercial basada en ubicación: restaurante, tienda, inmobiliaria, hotel, domicilio, transporte o flota. Tu negocio tiene un canal dentro del mapa.","a1_title":"Hazte visible donde ocurre la demanda","a1_text":"Activa un broadcast (geovalla) y permite que las personas cercanas descubran tu negocio. Registra nombre, teléfono y responsable.","a2_title":"Publica tu oferta","a2_text":"Ofrece productos, servicios, propiedades, domicilios y mucho más. Invita a tu equipo operativo y controla cupos según tu plan.","a3_title":"Planes, wallet y ePayco","a3_text":"Elige Starter, Growth, Business o Enterprise. Paga con ePayco. El pasajero paga directo al operativo; P2L se cubre con el plan y el saldo prepago.","a4_title":"Conecta directamente","a4_text":"Los usuarios y operativos pueden descubrir tu broadcast, suscribirse al canal y comunicarse contigo por chat cuando están cerca.","a5_title":"Administra tu operación","a5_text":"Gestiona tu empresa, equipo, servicios, flota y wallet desde el dashboard.","a6_title":"Prueba de 5 días","a6_text":"Al crear la empresa aplican los cupos del plan elegido. Luego renuevas con ePayco (30 días).","plans_title":"Planes P2L para tu negocio","plans_lead":"Tres tipos de empresa (movilidad, domicilios, reservas). Misma estructura del dashboard: cupos, wallet prepago y participación empresa sugerida. Prueba 5 días; los planes se renuevan con ePayco.","how_title":"Cómo activas el broadcast de tu canal geográfico","how_lead":"Empresa → broadcast (geovalla) → oferta → personas y operativos cercanos descubren el canal → se suscriben → chat → avisos al regresar.","step1_title":"Crea la empresa","step1_text":"Entra al dashboard, registra tu restaurante, tienda, propiedad, hotel, comercio, domicilio o flota y elige el plan de prueba.","step2_title":"Activa zona y equipo","step2_text":"Define tu broadcast (geovalla), publica tu oferta e invita operativos. Controla cupos según el plan contratado.","step3_title":"Opera y renueva","step3_text":"Monitorea wallet, servicios y suscriptores. Cuando termine la prueba, paga con ePayco para renovar 30 días.","enter_panel":"Entrar al panel empresa","cta_title":"Activa el broadcast de tu canal geográfico","cta_text":"Tu negocio tiene un canal dentro del mapa. Usuarios y operativos descubren tus productos, servicios, propiedades o domicilios cuando están cerca.","register_driver":"Entrar como operativo","open_fleet":"Abrir panel empresa"},"plans":{"starter_headline":"Starter — Recarga base","starter_micro":"Ideal para validar tu modelo de negocio sin riesgo","starter_f1":"1 operativo","starter_f2":"200 viajes habilitados","starter_f3":"Participación empresa sugerida: 20% del valor del viaje","starter_f4":"Prueba completa por 5 días","starter_billing":"Entrada / recarga base","growth_headline":"Growth — Opera en serio","growth_micro":"Para negocios que ya están generando ingresos","growth_f1":"Hasta 10 operativos","growth_f2":"2.000 viajes habilitados","growth_f3":"Participación empresa sugerida: 20% del valor del viaje","growth_f4":"Panel de gestión + soporte básico","growth_billing":"Suscripción: 30 días (ePayco)","business_headline":"Business — Escala","business_micro":"Para empresas que quieren crecer sin límites técnicos","business_f1":"Hasta 25 operativos","business_f2":"6.000 viajes habilitados","business_f3":"Participación empresa sugerida: 20% del valor del viaje","business_f4":"Analítica y soporte prioritario","business_billing":"Suscripción: 30 días (ePayco)","enterprise_headline":"Enterprise · Tu plataforma","enterprise_micro":"Tenant y BD aislados para operar una ciudad","enterprise_f1":"Hasta 100 conductores (City)","enterprise_f2":"~35.000 viajes/año de capacidad","enterprise_f3":"Landing, tarifas y geocanales propios","enterprise_f4":"Watchdog + soporte 24/7/365","enterprise_billing":"Ver planes Enterprise ↓","price_starter":"$80.000 COP","price_growth":"$700.000 COP / mes","price_business":"$1.800.000 COP / mes","price_enterprise":"Desde $1.500.000 COP / mes"},"enterprise":{"title":"Enterprise · Tenant dedicado","weight":"Peso 1 viaje = 10,76 KB","th_product":"Producto","th_price":"Precio mensual sugerido","th_storage":"Almacenamiento anual cubierto","th_year":"Capacidad viajes/año","th_month":"Viajes/mes","th_day":"Viajes/día","th_needed":"Conductores realizando un promedio de 10 viajes x día","city_storage":"0,5 GB/año","city_year":"~35.000","city_month":"~2.917","city_day":"~97","city_needed":"~10","pro_storage":"~0,7 GB/año","pro_year":"~62.500","pro_month":"~5.208","pro_day":"~173","pro_needed":"~17","business_storage":"~1,61 GB/año","business_year":"~150.000","business_month":"~12.500","business_day":"~417","business_needed":"~42","corporate_storage":"~1,94 GB/año","corporate_year":"~180.000","corporate_month":"~15.000","corporate_day":"~500","corporate_needed":"~50","xl_price":"Cotización","xl_storage":"Cotización","xl_year":"A medida","xl_month":"A medida","xl_day":"A medida","xl_needed":"A medida","shared_title":"Todos los planes Enterprise incluyen","shared_f1":"1 tenant aislado + base de datos aislada","shared_f2":"Landing comercial propia","shared_f3":"Tarifas y planes personalizados","shared_f4":"Geocanales y geovallas","shared_f5":"Integración de plataforma de pagos","shared_f6":"Watchdog IA 24/7 + escalamiento humano","shared_f7":"Soporte humano 24/7/365","shared_f8":"Pasajeros registrados: sin límite comercial rígido","shared_f9":"Soporte de desarrollo (tarifas e integración de pagos)","cta":"Contactar ventas Enterprise"},"geo":{"slogan":"Tu ubicación conecta la oferta con la demanda","heading":"Una plataforma. Tres experiencias.","pillars":"Movilidad | Bienes y servicios | Domicilios","lead":"P2L conecta personas, empresas, bienes y servicios según su ubicación. Todo conectado por canales geográficos, geovallas y broadcast.","airbnb_tag":"Bienes y servicios","airbnb_title":"Marketplace local, con broadcast","airbnb_text":"Descubre negocios, propiedades, productos y servicios cerca de ti. Una referencia Airbnb-like: la oferta local aparece cuando estás en la zona.","delivery_tag":"Domicilios","delivery_title":"Solicita lo que opera en tu zona","delivery_text":"Restaurantes y comercios definen su radio. El usuario pide productos y servicios por el canal — una referencia Rappi-like, dentro de P2L.","geofence_tag":"Broadcast","geofence_title":"Geovalla y suscripción al canal","geofence_text":"La empresa activa un broadcast (geovalla), publica su oferta y las personas cercanas se suscriben al canal y chatean. Al regresar a la zona, pueden volver a conectar."},"footer":{"blurb":"P2L conecta personas, empresas, bienes y servicios según su ubicación. Movilidad, marketplace local y domicilios con canales geográficos y broadcast.","passengers":"Usuario","drivers":"Operativo","company":"Empresa","enter_app":"Entrar a la app","register":"Registrarme","open_app":"Abrir app","admin_dash":"Dashboard admin","plans":"Planes","how":"Cómo funciona","terms":"Condiciones de Uso","privacy":"Política de Privacidad","copy":"P2L · Plataforma geográfica"},"payments":{"meta_title":"Tarifas y pagos — P2L Empresa","meta_description":"P2L no recauda ni custodia el valor de los servicios. El pago se realiza entre las partes. El costo de plataforma se paga anticipadamente con el saldo de la empresa; no se cobra de nuevo en cada viaje.","back":"Volver a Empresa","eyebrow":"Empresa · Tarifas y pagos","title":"Modelo de operación y pagos de P2L","lead":"P2L conecta pasajeros, operadores y empresas <strong>sin custodiar el dinero de los viajes</strong>.","problem":"El problema no es el modelo financiero, sino el lenguaje. Términos como Settlement, ledger, driverShare o take rate son correctos técnicamente, pero para un usuario final suenan a contabilidad interna.","names_note":"Los nombres técnicos se mantienen entre paréntesis cuando sirven para documentación de desarrollo. Primero va el término comercial.","s1_title":"1. Flujo de dinero","s1_img_alt":"Esquema de costos, tarifas, transacciones y planes de pago P2L","s1_img_caption":"P2L no cobra una comisión sobre el valor de cada viaje. La empresa contrata y paga anticipadamente el uso de la plataforma mediante un plan y un saldo prepago. El valor del viaje se distribuye entre el conductor y la empresa según las condiciones de operación definidas por la empresa.","s1_p1":"P2L no recibe ni guarda el dinero que el pasajero paga por el viaje. El pasajero le paga directamente al conductor. Quien liquida económicamente a la empresa es el conductor, según las reglas de la operación. P2L solo registra esa distribución; no transfiere esos montos.","s1_p2":"La empresa compra un plan. Ese plan cubre el costo de la plataforma: no se cobra un porcentaje adicional en el momento del viaje.","phrase_label":"Frase visible del modelo","quote":"P2L no recauda ni custodia el valor de los servicios realizados entre usuarios, empresas y operadores. El pago del servicio se realiza directamente entre las partes. El costo de P2L se paga anticipadamente mediante el saldo de la empresa. En cada viaje, P2L registra y consume el valor correspondiente del saldo, pero no recibe nuevamente dinero del pasajero ni del operativo.","s1_p3":"El costo de P2L es un costo de operación tecnológica pagado por adelantado, no una comisión que se cobre otra vez sobre cada viaje.","s1_p4":"Estas dos frases explican prácticamente todo el modelo financiero en lenguaje humano.","split_driver":"Operativo","split_driver_text":"Participación del viaje. Recibe el pago del pasajero","split_company":"Empresa","split_company_text":"Ingreso bruto / participación del viaje","split_p2l":"Plataforma","split_p2l_text":"El plan cubre el costo de la plataforma","s2_title":"2. Los cuatro participantes del modelo","pax_title":"Usuario / Pasajero","pax_l1":"Consulta el valor estimado antes de solicitar.","pax_l2":"Puede participar en una puja, cuando esté habilitada.","pax_l3":"Paga el viaje directamente al conductor.","pax_l4":"No paga a P2L por el viaje. P2L no recibe ese dinero.","op_title":"Operativo / Conductor","op_l1":"Realiza el viaje y recibe directamente el pago del pasajero.","op_l2":"Registra en P2L el valor final y el medio de pago utilizado.","op_l3":"Liquida económicamente a la empresa su participación (en el ejemplo, $4.000). P2L no transfiere ese dinero.","op_l4":"No necesita un saldo P2L propio. P2L no le cobra de nuevo por el viaje.","co_title":"Empresa","co_l1":"Administra sus conductores y su operación.","co_l2":"Define sus tarifas dentro de los límites establecidos por P2L.","co_l3":"Compra plan o recarga saldo P2L para usar la infraestructura.","co_l4":"Consulta viajes, participaciones y el consumo de su saldo prepago.","co_l5":"Los $4.000 del ejemplo son la participación empresa sugerida / ingreso bruto del viaje.","pl_title":"P2L / Plataforma","pl_l1":"Proporciona la tecnología para conectar pasajeros, operadores y empresas.","pl_l2":"Registra los viajes y la distribución económica (80 / 20 / 0).","pl_l3":"El plan cubre el costo de la plataforma. No cobra un porcentaje adicional en el momento del viaje.","pl_l4":"No cobra de nuevo al pasajero ni al operativo por cada viaje.","pl_l5":"No custodia ni liquida el dinero del viaje entre las partes.","s3_title":"3. Vocabulario comercial vs. técnico","th_tech":"Técnico","th_user":"Para usuario / documentación comercial","v_fare":"Valor final del viaje","v_pay":"Medio de pago","v_settle":"Registro de distribución del viaje","v_driver":"Participación del operativo","v_company":"Participación / ingreso bruto de la empresa","v_fee":"Costo de plataforma ya prepagado (plan y saldo)","v_wallet":"Saldo P2L","v_debit":"Consumo del saldo P2L","v_take":"Porcentaje de costo de plataforma","v_accrual":"Valor registrado a favor","v_ledger":"Registro de movimientos","v_topup_tech":"recarga wallet","v_topup":"Recarga de saldo P2L","v_settlement":"Distribución registrada","v_clamp":"Límites mínimo y máximo","vocab_note":"Se evita el término contable <strong>devengo</strong> en la documentación dirigida a usuarios. En su lugar: <strong>20% participación / ingreso bruto de la empresa</strong>.","s4_title":"3. Cómo se cubre P2L","s4_p1":"P2L se cubre con el plan y el saldo prepago de la empresa. No hay comisión sobre el valor del viaje.","s4_name":"Servicio P2L cubierto con plan y saldo prepago","s4_p2":"El pasajero paga directamente al operativo. La empresa define o recibe una participación sobre el valor del viaje. P2L ya monetiza su servicio con el plan y el saldo prepago de la empresa: no cobra de nuevo en el momento del viaje.","s4_ledger_lead":"Hay dos flujos contables en paralelo. Uno es el consumo del plan de la empresa registrada. El otro es el pago del usuario al conductor, que P2L solo registra.","s4_ledger_img_alt":"Dos flujos contables: consumo del plan y pago del viaje","s4_ledger_img_caption":"P2L no calcula una comisión sobre el valor del viaje. Monetiza con plan y prepago. El dinero del pasajero va al conductor; la empresa recibe su participación fuera de P2L.","s4_plan_title":"Consumo del plan","s4_plan_text":"La empresa registrada paga el plan. Ese pago carga el saldo. P2L consume del saldo el uso de la plataforma.","s4_plan_n1":"Empresa","s4_plan_e1":"paga plan","s4_plan_e2":"consumo","s4_meanwhile":"Mientras:","s4_ride_title":"Pago de usuarios a conductores","s4_ride_text":"El pasajero paga al conductor. P2L registra el viaje y la distribución con la empresa (80 / 20 / 0). No transfiere ese dinero.","s4_ride_n1":"Pasajero","s4_ride_n2":"Conductor","s4_ledger_company":"La empresa registrada no cobra el viaje a través de P2L. Recibe su 20% del conductor, según las reglas de la operación. El plan habilita la infraestructura; el viaje se liquida entre las partes.","s5_title":"4. Participación empresa sugerida según tu plan","th_plan":"Plan","th_pct":"Participación empresa sugerida","th_share":"Participación empresa sugerida","th_fixed":"Valor fijo","th_min":"Mínimo","th_max":"Máximo","th_concept":"Concepto","th_value":"Valor","s5_starter":"20% del valor del viaje","s5_growth":"20% del valor del viaje","s5_business":"20% del valor del viaje","s5_enterprise":"Por contacto comercial","s5_p1":"La empresa define o recibe esa participación sobre el valor del viaje. El pasajero paga al operativo. P2L no presenta ese porcentaje como un cobro adicional en el momento del viaje: su servicio ya está cubierto por el plan y el saldo prepago.","s6_title":"5. Ejemplo: viaje de $20.000","s6_p1":"El plan cubre el costo de la plataforma (0% en el viaje). La empresa recibe el 20% del valor: $4.000. P2L no cobra de nuevo al pasajero ni al operativo.","s6_p2":"El pasajero entrega <strong>$20.000</strong> directamente al conductor. <strong>P2L no recibe esos $20.000.</strong>","s6_l1":"El conductor recibe <strong>$20.000</strong>.","s6_l2":"No recibe físicamente $16.000.","s6_p3":"Los $16.000 / $4.000 / $0 son la <strong>distribución económica registrada</strong>. P2L no hace tres transferencias. Quien liquida a la empresa es el conductor. P2L solo anota que $4.000 son la participación de la empresa. El plan cubre el costo de la plataforma.","s6_p4":"El plan cubre el costo de la plataforma. En este viaje ese costo es 0% sobre el valor que paga el pasajero.","s6_p5":"Los <strong>$4.000 son la participación empresa sugerida</strong> / ingreso bruto de ese viaje. No representan un retorno sobre inversión.","s6_key":"El costo de P2L lo cubre el plan. En cada viaje P2L no cobra un porcentaje adicional al pasajero ni al operativo.","s6_r1":"Pasajero paga al conductor","s6_r2":"Participación del operativo","s6_r3":"Participación de la empresa (ingreso bruto)","s6_r4":"Uso de plataforma P2L (el plan cubre el costo)","s6_r5":"P2L recibe del pasajero","s6_r6":"P2L cobra nuevamente al conductor","s6_r7":"P2L descuenta del saldo prepago","s6_clarify_title":"Aclaración","s6_clarify_lead":"P2L no recibe los $20.000 y no resuelve dentro de su plataforma:","s6_c1":"custodia de fondos","s6_c2":"devolución del dinero del viaje","s6_c3":"saldo del pasajero","s6_c4":"transferencia al conductor","s6_c5":"conciliación bancaria de cada pago del pasajero","s6_c6":"chargebacks del pago del viaje","s6_c7":"errores de distribución del dinero recibido","s6_c8":"fondos de terceros pendientes de entregar","s7_title":"6. Saldo P2L de la empresa","s7_p1":"Para el usuario final, <em>wallet</em> puede hacer pensar que P2L guarda el dinero del pasajero. El nombre comercial es <strong>saldo P2L de la empresa</strong>.","s7_p2":"El saldo P2L es un prepago de la empresa para usar la infraestructura. No es el dinero de los pasajeros ni el saldo de los conductores. El plan cubre el costo de la plataforma: en el viaje de ejemplo ese costo es $0.","s7_flow_label":"Flujo operativo:","s7_flow":"Empresa → recarga saldo P2L → P2L consume el costo de plataforma del saldo → la empresa puede continuar operando.","s8_title":"7. Cómo opera el ciclo","s8_l1":"El pasajero paga directamente al conductor.","s8_l2":"El conductor registra el valor final del viaje.","s8_l3":"P2L registra la distribución: operativo, empresa y costo de plataforma ya prepagado.","s8_l4":"El conductor liquida a la empresa su participación. P2L no transfiere ese dinero.","s8_l5":"P2L consume del saldo prepago el costo de plataforma de ese viaje. No cobra de nuevo al pasajero ni al operativo.","s8_l6":"La empresa recarga su saldo cuando lo necesita.","tech_title":"Nota técnica","tech_p1":"Internamente el consumo del plan queda en subscriptionpayments, companywallet y wallettransactions. El viaje y su distribución (80 / 20 / 0) quedan en rides y ridesettlements. No hay comisión calculada sobre el valor del viaje.","tech_p2":"Hay dos capas de lenguaje: arriba lo entiende cualquier empresario o usuario; abajo lo entiende el desarrollador que está leyendo la documentación del sistema.","cta_title":"Activa tu empresa en P2L","cta_text":"Recarga tu saldo y opera con una distribución clara: 80% operativo, 20% empresa, 0% plataforma (el plan cubre el costo).","cta_panel":"Entrar al panel empresa"}}},"en":{"translation":{"meta":{"title_passenger":"P2L User — Discover what you need near you","title_driver":"P2L Operator — Operate where the demand is","title_fleet":"P2L Business — Turn your location into a sales channel","description":"P2L is a location-based platform connecting supply and demand for mobility, goods, services, and deliveries through geographic channels, geofences, and broadcast."},"nav":{"benefits":"Benefits","services":"Services","how":"How it works","drivers":"Operator","fleet":"Business","plans":"Plans","payments":"Fares and payments","use_tuki":"Go to the platform","menu_open":"Open menu","menu_close":"Close menu","main":"Main","home":"P2L home","profile_tabs":"Choose your profile","language":"Language","whatsapp":"Contact via WhatsApp at +57 318 781 3116"},"modes":{"passenger":"User","driver":"Operator","fleet":"Business"},"hero":{"passenger":{"eyebrow":"👤 User · Supply and demand near you","title":"Discover what you need <em>near you</em>","lead":"Move, discover businesses, find services, and request products based on your location. P2L connects your demand with nearby supply.","badges":[{"icon":"🚗","strong":"Mobility","rest":"nearby rides"},{"icon":"🛍️","strong":"Discover","rest":"local supply"},{"icon":"🛵","strong":"Deliveries","rest":"in your area"}],"pill":"Near you","phone_title":"Offer 120 m away","phone_sub":"Geo channel · Chat active"},"driver":{"eyebrow":"⚙️ Operator · Driver, courier, or field worker","title":"Operate where the <em>demand</em> is","lead":"Receive requests, fulfill services, and discover opportunities as you move through your area. Operators also take part in P2L’s supply-and-demand network.","badges":[{"icon":"📍","strong":"Requests","rest":"near you"},{"icon":"⚡","strong":"Real time","rest":"status and routes"},{"icon":"🛍️","strong":"Discover","rest":"offers on your route"}],"pill":"Online","phone_title":"New request 350 m away","phone_sub":"Accept · Operate · Complete"},"fleet":{"eyebrow":"🏢 Business · Geographic channel broadcast","title":"Turn your location into a <em>sales channel</em>","lead":"Activate the broadcast of your geographic channel (geofence) and let people and operators discover your business, products, and services when they are nearby. Your company. Your zone. Your channel.","badges":[{"icon":"📡","strong":"Broadcast","rest":"geofence and subscription"},{"icon":"💬","strong":"Chat","rest":"with subscribers"},{"icon":"🛍️","strong":"Offer","rest":"goods, services, deliveries"}],"pill":"Broadcast live","phone_title":"Your business on the map","phone_sub":"Broadcast · Offer · Chat"}},"passenger":{"benefits_title":"P2L connects your demand with nearby supply","benefits_lead":"Supply and demand connected by location: mobility, goods and services, and deliveries on one geographic platform.","b1_title":"Mobility","b1_text":"Request a ride and find available operators near you. Map, chat, and live tracking.","b2_title":"Discover","b2_text":"Find restaurants, shops, properties, and services around your location — even if you have not requested a ride.","b3_title":"Deliveries","b3_text":"Request products and services from businesses that operate in your area, through the company’s geographic channel broadcast.","services_title":"Choose how you want to take part in P2L","services_lead":"One platform. Three ways in: user, operator, or business. Everything connected by location.","s1_tag":"User","s1_title":"Discover, request, and move","s1_text":"Request a ride, find nearby businesses, order deliveries, and subscribe to geographic channel broadcast.","s2_tag":"Operator","s2_title":"Receive requests and fulfill services","s2_text":"Driver, courier, or field operator: fulfill nearby services and also discover local supply.","s3_tag":"Business","s3_title":"Publish your offer and activate your channel","s3_text":"Restaurant, shop, realtor, hotel, fleet, or store: your business has a channel inside the map.","s4_tag":"Mobility","s4_title":"Uber-like, your way","s4_text":"Request a ride, set origin and destination, and connect with available operators near you.","s5_tag":"Marketplace","s5_title":"Airbnb-like local","s5_text":"Discover properties, restaurants, shops, and professional services around your location.","s6_tag":"Deliveries","s6_title":"Rappi-like in your area","s6_text":"Enter the broadcast (geofence), discover a business, subscribe to its channel, and get alerts when you return.","how_title":"Use P2L in 3 steps","how_lead":"Sign in with Google and start discovering nearby supply.","step1_title":"Sign in","step1_text":"Access with Google from the web or your device. No long forms.","step2_title":"Discover by location","step2_text":"Move around, find nearby businesses, or request a ride or a delivery in your area.","step3_title":"Connect with supply","step3_text":"Subscribe to the geographic channel broadcast, chat with the business, and get alerts when you return.","start_free":"Start now — it's free","highlight_title":"Your location connects supply with demand","highlight_text":"Broadcast is the business geofence: Airbnb with a fixed point, delivery in an operating radius, or the venue you just walked into. Subscribe once to the channel; when you return, the app notifies you and opens chat with the business. An Uber-like experience to move, Airbnb-like to discover local supply, and Rappi-like to request deliveries.","explore":"Explore the app","lost_title":"Forgot something in the vehicle?","lost_text":"If you used mobility, you can contact the operator from the app or report an issue to get help.","go_app":"Go to the app","cta_title":"Want to operate with P2L?","cta_text":"Receive requests, fulfill services, and discover opportunities in your area. You can also register your business and activate your geographic channel broadcast.","register_driver":"Enter as operator","fleet_panel":"Business"},"driver":{"benefits_title":"Connect your work with demand in your area","benefits_lead":"Operators do more than fulfill services. They also take part in P2L’s supply-and-demand network as they move.","b1_title":"Nearby requests","b1_text":"Receive services and requests from users who are nearby: rides, deliveries, or field work.","b2_title":"Real-time operations","b2_text":"Manage statuses, routes, requests, and services from your device, whenever you choose to go online.","b3_title":"Chat","b3_text":"Coordinate directly with users and businesses. The same conversation in the app and on the dashboard.","services_title":"Operator capabilities","services_lead":"Driver, courier, operator, or service staff: everything you need to operate on the geographic platform.","s1_tag":"Availability","s1_title":"Online mode","s1_text":"Go online to receive nearby requests and pause when you are not available.","s2_tag":"Matching","s2_title":"Accept or decline","s2_text":"Review origin, destination, and estimated value before accepting a service.","s3_tag":"Operations","s3_title":"Service in progress","s3_text":"Manage status: on the way, at the meeting point, and completed.","s4_tag":"Map","s4_title":"Live route","s4_text":"See the route and the user’s location throughout the service.","s5_tag":"Activity","s5_title":"Service history","s5_text":"Review completed services and recent activity for the day.","s6_tag":"P2L network","s6_title":"Discover while you operate","s6_text":"As you move through an area you can also discover nearby businesses, services, properties, and offers, subscribe to the channel broadcast, and chat.","how_title":"Start operating in 3 steps","how_lead":"Register in the panel, join a company or create yours, and open the app.","step1_title":"Register","step1_text":"Enter the company panel and create or join an organization.","step2_title":"Activate your role","step2_text":"The admin adds you as an operator. You open the app and sign in.","step3_title":"Receive requests","step3_text":"Go online, accept nearby services, and discover supply in your area.","open_app":"Open operator app","highlight_title":"Operators also take part in the network","highlight_text":"You do more than fulfill services. Enter the radius of a shop, a property, or a delivery zone, subscribe to the channel broadcast, and the business can reconnect when you return.","go_panel":"Go to the panel","cta_title":"Operate with P2L","cta_text":"Connect your work with demand in your area and discover nearby businesses as you move. You can also register your own company.","register_driver":"Enter as operator","fleet_panel":"Business"},"fleet":{"benefits_title":"Your company. Your zone. Your channel.","benefits_lead":"P2L lets any business activate a location-based commercial presence: restaurant, shop, realtor, hotel, delivery, transport, or fleet. Your business has a channel inside the map.","a1_title":"Get visible where demand happens","a1_text":"Activate a broadcast (geofence) and let nearby people discover your business. Register name, phone, and responsible person.","a2_title":"Publish your offer","a2_text":"Offer products, services, properties, deliveries, and more. Invite your operations team and control seats according to your plan.","a3_title":"Plans, wallet, and ePayco","a3_text":"Choose Starter, Growth, Business, or Enterprise. Pay with ePayco. The passenger pays the operator directly; P2L is covered by the plan and the prepaid balance.","a4_title":"Connect directly","a4_text":"Users and operators can discover your broadcast, subscribe to the channel, and chat with you when they are nearby.","a5_title":"Run your operation","a5_text":"Manage your company, team, services, fleet, and wallet from the dashboard.","a6_title":"5-day trial","a6_text":"When you create the company, the chosen plan quotas apply. Then you renew with ePayco (30 days).","plans_title":"P2L plans for your business","plans_lead":"Three company types (mobility, deliveries, bookings). Same dashboard structure: seats, prepaid wallet, and suggested company participation. 5-day trial; paid plans renew with ePayco.","how_title":"How you activate your geographic channel broadcast","how_lead":"Business → broadcast (geofence) → offer → nearby people and operators discover the channel → they subscribe → chat → alerts when they return.","step1_title":"Create the company","step1_text":"Enter the dashboard, register your restaurant, shop, property, hotel, store, delivery, or fleet, and choose the trial plan.","step2_title":"Activate zone and team","step2_text":"Set your broadcast (geofence), publish your offer, and invite operators. Control seats according to the contracted plan.","step3_title":"Operate and renew","step3_text":"Monitor wallet, services, and subscribers. When the trial ends, pay with ePayco to renew 30 days.","enter_panel":"Enter the company panel","cta_title":"Activate your geographic channel broadcast","cta_text":"Your business has a channel inside the map. Users and operators discover your products, services, properties, or deliveries when they are nearby.","register_driver":"Enter as operator","open_fleet":"Open company panel"},"plans":{"starter_headline":"Starter — Base top-up","starter_micro":"Ideal to validate your business model with no risk","starter_f1":"1 operator","starter_f2":"200 enabled trips","starter_f3":"Suggested company participation: 20% of the trip value","starter_f4":"Full 5-day trial","starter_billing":"Entry / base top-up","growth_headline":"Growth — Operate for real","growth_micro":"For businesses already generating revenue","growth_f1":"Up to 10 operators","growth_f2":"2,000 enabled trips","growth_f3":"Suggested company participation: 20% of the trip value","growth_f4":"Management panel + basic support","growth_billing":"Subscription: 30 days (ePayco)","business_headline":"Business — Scale","business_micro":"For companies that want to grow without technical limits","business_f1":"Up to 25 operators","business_f2":"6,000 enabled trips","business_f3":"Suggested company participation: 20% of the trip value","business_f4":"Analytics and priority support","business_billing":"Subscription: 30 days (ePayco)","enterprise_headline":"Enterprise · Your platform","enterprise_micro":"Isolated tenant and DB to run a city","enterprise_f1":"Up to 100 drivers (City)","enterprise_f2":"~35,000 trips/year capacity","enterprise_f3":"Own landing, fares, and geo-channels","enterprise_f4":"Watchdog + 24/7/365 support","enterprise_billing":"See Enterprise plans ↓","price_starter":"$80,000 COP","price_growth":"$700,000 COP / month","price_business":"$1,800,000 COP / month","price_enterprise":"From $1,500,000 COP / month"},"enterprise":{"title":"Enterprise · Dedicated tenant","weight":"Weight 1 trip = 10.76 KB","th_product":"Product","th_price":"Suggested monthly price","th_storage":"Annual storage covered","th_year":"Trip capacity/year","th_month":"Trips/month","th_day":"Trips/day","th_needed":"Drivers averaging 10 trips/day","city_storage":"0.5 GB/year","city_year":"~35,000","city_month":"~2,917","city_day":"~97","city_needed":"~10","pro_storage":"~0.7 GB/year","pro_year":"~62,500","pro_month":"~5,208","pro_day":"~173","pro_needed":"~17","business_storage":"~1.61 GB/year","business_year":"~150,000","business_month":"~12,500","business_day":"~417","business_needed":"~42","corporate_storage":"~1.94 GB/year","corporate_year":"~180,000","corporate_month":"~15,000","corporate_day":"~500","corporate_needed":"~50","xl_price":"Quote","xl_storage":"Quote","xl_year":"Custom","xl_month":"Custom","xl_day":"Custom","xl_needed":"Custom","shared_title":"All Enterprise plans include","shared_f1":"1 isolated tenant + isolated database","shared_f2":"Own commercial landing","shared_f3":"Custom fares and plans","shared_f4":"Geo-channels and geofences","shared_f5":"Payment platform integration","shared_f6":"24/7 AI Watchdog + human escalation","shared_f7":"24/7/365 human support","shared_f8":"Registered passengers: no rigid commercial limit","shared_f9":"Development support (fares and payment integration)","cta":"Contact Enterprise sales"},"geo":{"slogan":"Your location connects supply with demand","heading":"One platform. Three experiences.","pillars":"Mobility | Goods and services | Deliveries","lead":"P2L connects people, businesses, goods, and services by location. Everything tied together by geographic channels, geofences, and broadcast.","airbnb_tag":"Goods and services","airbnb_title":"Local marketplace, with broadcast","airbnb_text":"Discover businesses, properties, products, and services near you. An Airbnb-like reference: local supply appears when you are in the zone.","delivery_tag":"Deliveries","delivery_title":"Request what operates in your area","delivery_text":"Restaurants and shops set their radius. Users order products and services through the channel — a Rappi-like reference, inside P2L.","geofence_tag":"Broadcast","geofence_title":"Geofence and channel subscription","geofence_text":"The company activates a broadcast (geofence), publishes its offer, and nearby people subscribe to the channel and chat. When they return to the zone, they can reconnect."},"footer":{"blurb":"P2L connects people, businesses, goods, and services by location. Mobility, local marketplace, and deliveries with geographic channels and broadcast.","passengers":"User","drivers":"Operator","company":"Business","enter_app":"Enter the app","register":"Register","open_app":"Open app","admin_dash":"Admin dashboard","plans":"Plans","how":"How it works","terms":"Terms of Use","privacy":"Privacy Policy","copy":"P2L · Geographic platform"},"payments":{"meta_title":"Fares and payments — P2L Business","meta_description":"P2L does not collect or hold the value of services. Payment happens between the parties. Platform cost is prepaid from the company balance; it is not charged again on each trip.","back":"Back to Business","eyebrow":"Business · Fares and payments","title":"P2L operating and payment model","lead":"P2L connects passengers, operators, and companies <strong>without holding trip money</strong>.","problem":"The issue is not the financial model, but the language. Terms like Settlement, ledger, driverShare, or take rate are technically correct, but they sound like internal accounting to an end user.","names_note":"Technical names stay in parentheses when they help development docs. The commercial term comes first.","s1_title":"1. Money flow","s1_img_alt":"P2L costs, fares, transactions, and payment plans diagram","s1_img_caption":"P2L does not charge a commission on the value of each trip. The company contracts and prepays for platform use through a plan and a prepaid balance. The trip value is split between the driver and the company according to the operating conditions defined by the company.","s1_p1":"P2L does not receive or hold the money the passenger pays for the trip. The passenger pays the driver directly. The driver settles economically with the company, according to the operation’s rules. P2L only records that split; it does not transfer those amounts.","s1_p2":"The company buys a plan. That plan covers the platform cost: no extra percentage is charged at trip time.","phrase_label":"Visible model phrase","quote":"P2L does not collect or hold the value of services performed between users, companies, and operators. Payment is made directly between the parties. P2L’s cost is paid in advance through the company balance. On each trip, P2L records and consumes the corresponding amount from that balance, but it does not receive money again from the passenger or the operator.","s1_p3":"P2L’s cost is a prepaid technology operating cost, not a commission charged again on each trip.","s1_p4":"These two sentences explain almost the entire financial model in plain language.","split_driver":"Operator","split_driver_text":"Trip share. Receives the passenger payment","split_company":"Company","split_company_text":"Gross income / trip participation","split_p2l":"Platform","split_p2l_text":"The plan covers the platform cost","s2_title":"2. The four participants","pax_title":"User / Passenger","pax_l1":"Sees the estimated value before requesting.","pax_l2":"Can join a bid when that option is enabled.","pax_l3":"Pays the driver directly.","pax_l4":"Does not pay P2L for the trip. P2L does not receive that money.","op_title":"Operator / Driver","op_l1":"Completes the trip and receives the passenger payment directly.","op_l2":"Records the final value and payment method in P2L.","op_l3":"Settles the company share economically (in the example, $4,000). P2L does not transfer that money.","op_l4":"Does not need a personal P2L balance. P2L does not charge the driver again for the trip.","co_title":"Company","co_l1":"Manages its drivers and operation.","co_l2":"Sets fares within the limits defined by P2L.","co_l3":"Buys a plan or tops up a P2L balance to use the infrastructure.","co_l4":"Reviews trips, shares, and prepaid-balance consumption.","co_l5":"The $4,000 in the example is the suggested company participation / gross income from the trip.","pl_title":"P2L / Platform","pl_l1":"Provides the technology that connects passengers, operators, and companies.","pl_l2":"Records trips and the economic split (80 / 20 / 0).","pl_l3":"The plan covers the platform cost. It does not charge an extra percentage at trip time.","pl_l4":"It does not charge the passenger or the operator again on each trip.","pl_l5":"Does not hold or settle trip money between the parties.","s3_title":"3. Commercial vs. technical vocabulary","th_tech":"Technical","th_user":"For users / commercial docs","v_fare":"Final trip value","v_pay":"Payment method","v_settle":"Trip split record","v_driver":"Operator share","v_company":"Company participation / gross income","v_fee":"Prepaid platform cost (plan and balance)","v_wallet":"P2L balance","v_debit":"P2L balance consumption","v_take":"Platform cost percentage","v_accrual":"Amount recorded in favor","v_ledger":"Movement record","v_topup_tech":"wallet top-up","v_topup":"P2L balance top-up","v_settlement":"Recorded split","v_clamp":"Minimum and maximum limits","vocab_note":"The accounting term <strong>accrual</strong> is avoided in user-facing docs. Use <strong>20% company participation / gross income</strong> instead.","s4_title":"3. How P2L is covered","s4_p1":"P2L is covered by the company plan and prepaid balance. There is no commission on the trip value.","s4_name":"P2L service covered by the plan and prepaid balance","s4_p2":"The passenger pays the operator directly. The company defines or receives a share of the trip value. P2L already monetizes its service through the plan and the company’s prepaid balance: it does not charge again at trip time.","s4_ledger_lead":"There are two accounting flows in parallel. One is plan consumption by the registered company. The other is the passenger payment to the driver, which P2L only records.","s4_ledger_img_alt":"Two accounting flows: plan consumption and trip payment","s4_ledger_img_caption":"P2L does not calculate a commission on the trip value. It monetizes with the plan and prepaid balance. Passenger money goes to the driver; the company receives its share outside P2L.","s4_plan_title":"Plan consumption","s4_plan_text":"The registered company pays the plan. That payment funds the balance. P2L consumes platform use from that balance.","s4_plan_n1":"Company","s4_plan_e1":"pays plan","s4_plan_e2":"consumption","s4_meanwhile":"Meanwhile:","s4_ride_title":"Passenger-to-driver payment","s4_ride_text":"The passenger pays the driver. P2L records the trip and the split with the company (80 / 20 / 0). It does not transfer that money.","s4_ride_n1":"Passenger","s4_ride_n2":"Driver","s4_ledger_company":"The registered company does not collect the trip through P2L. It receives its 20% from the driver, according to the operation’s rules. The plan enables the infrastructure; the trip is settled between the parties.","s5_title":"4. Suggested company participation by plan","th_plan":"Plan","th_pct":"Suggested company participation","th_share":"Suggested company participation","th_fixed":"Fixed amount","th_min":"Minimum","th_max":"Maximum","th_concept":"Item","th_value":"Amount","s5_starter":"20% of the trip value","s5_growth":"20% of the trip value","s5_business":"20% of the trip value","s5_enterprise":"By commercial contact","s5_p1":"The company defines or receives that share of the trip value. The passenger pays the operator. P2L does not present that percentage as an extra charge at trip time: its service is already covered by the plan and the prepaid balance.","s6_title":"5. Example: a $20,000 trip","s6_p1":"The plan covers the platform cost (0% on the trip). The company receives 20% of the value: $4,000. P2L does not charge the passenger or the operator again.","s6_p2":"The passenger hands <strong>$20,000</strong> directly to the driver. <strong>P2L does not receive that $20,000.</strong>","s6_l1":"The driver receives <strong>$20,000</strong>.","s6_l2":"The driver does not physically receive $16,000.","s6_p3":"The $16,000 / $4,000 / $0 figures are the <strong>recorded economic split</strong>. P2L does not make three transfers. The driver settles with the company. P2L only records that $4,000 is the company share. The plan covers the platform cost.","s6_p4":"The plan covers the platform cost. On this trip that cost is 0% of the amount the passenger pays.","s6_p5":"The <strong>$4,000 is the suggested company participation</strong> / gross income from that trip. It is not a return on investment.","s6_key":"The plan covers P2L’s cost. On each trip P2L does not charge an extra percentage to the passenger or the operator.","s6_r1":"Passenger pays the driver","s6_r2":"Operator share","s6_r3":"Company share (gross income)","s6_r4":"P2L platform usage (the plan covers the cost)","s6_r5":"P2L receives from the passenger","s6_r6":"P2L charges the driver again","s6_r7":"P2L deducts from the prepaid balance","s6_clarify_title":"Clarification","s6_clarify_lead":"P2L does not receive the $20,000 and does not resolve inside its platform:","s6_c1":"custody of funds","s6_c2":"refund of trip money","s6_c3":"passenger balance","s6_c4":"transfer to the driver","s6_c5":"bank reconciliation of each passenger payment","s6_c6":"chargebacks on the trip payment","s6_c7":"errors distributing money received","s6_c8":"third-party funds pending delivery","s7_title":"6. Company P2L balance","s7_p1":"For an end user, <em>wallet</em> can sound like P2L holds passenger money. The commercial name is <strong>company P2L balance</strong>.","s7_p2":"The P2L balance is a prepaid amount the company uses for infrastructure. It is not passenger money and it is not the drivers’ balance. The plan covers the platform cost: in the example trip that cost is $0.","s7_flow_label":"Operating flow:","s7_flow":"Company → tops up P2L balance → P2L consumes platform cost from the balance → the company can keep operating.","s8_title":"7. How the cycle works","s8_l1":"The passenger pays the driver directly.","s8_l2":"The driver records the final trip value.","s8_l3":"P2L records the split: operator, company, and prepaid platform cost.","s8_l4":"The driver settles the company’s share. P2L does not transfer that money.","s8_l5":"P2L consumes the trip’s platform cost from the prepaid balance. It does not charge the passenger or the operator again.","s8_l6":"The company tops up its balance when needed.","tech_title":"Technical note","tech_p1":"Internally, plan consumption is stored in subscriptionpayments, companywallet, and wallettransactions. The trip and its split (80 / 20 / 0) are stored in rides and ridesettlements. There is no commission calculated on the trip value.","tech_p2":"There are two language layers: the top layer is clear to any business owner or user; the bottom layer is for the developer reading the system docs.","cta_title":"Activate your company on P2L","cta_text":"Top up your balance and operate with a clear split: 80% operator, 20% company, 0% platform (the plan covers the cost).","cta_panel":"Enter the company panel"}}}};
